            "review_title": "Review at Xvi.",
            "review_text": "Nga Hoang\n7 contributions\n0\nA NEW FAVOURITE SPOT IN THAODIEN\nDec 2025 • Friends\nAbsolutely loved my meal here! Every dish was full of flavour and honestly way better than I expected — in the best way. The team was super friendly and made me feel right at home from the moment I walked in. The vibe is cozy, lively, and just a really nice place to spend time. Already planning my next visit. Highly recommend if you want great food and a good mood!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nI saw they have pizza as well, will comeback to try them out\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 9, 2025",
