            "review_title": "Review at Xvi.",
            "review_text": "J. Villa\n7 contributions\n0\nStreetart, delicouse food and cool people\nNov 2025 • Friends\nMy friends and me met here last Saturday, as one of my friends found this beautiful place online. We did some pictures of the cool location with the Streetart on the walls and ate breakfast. I ate the Scrambled Eggs which came with roasted Potatoes and a salad. My friends ate the Vegetable Risotto, the Sourdough with Avocado and the Banh mi. We will defiantly come back, next time for Dinner to see the place at night.\nRead more\nWritten November 18, 2025",
